invariant: INV-69
file: src/mlkem.c
catches: test/mlkem-builds.sh
reason: an arm64 host object's mlk_matvec_row samples every entry with
  mlk_sample_ntt, so ML-KEM's matrix runs one Keccak state at a time.
  Every value stays the same, so the script compiles mlkem.c for arm64
  and requires it to call mlk_sample_pair_neon.

--- old
        if (rank - j < MLK_NEON_ENTRIES) {
--- new
        if (rank - j < MLK_NEON_ENTRIES + 4) {
